  "html": "<!-- wp:image {\"id\":496,\"width\":\"400px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/free-printable-bookmarks-divergentjournaler.png\" alt=\"Free Printable Bookmarks\" class=\"wp-image-496\" style=\"width:400px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I have a love affair with bookmarks in all sizes and shapes, paper or metal; I just love bookmarks. Making free printable bookmarks allows me to save a bundle and keep this love affair moving right along! </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bookmarks serve as convenient tools for marking your place. They allow you easy access to any section in your journal. Because so many things happen in my journal simultaneously, I generally have four or five going at a time. Bookmarks also serve to help in studying, reading books, and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Below, you will see the bookmarks that I currently have available. Each will link to the printable PDF located on GDrive. If you would like to bypass downloading them individually, you can sign up for full access to the <a href=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/divergent-vault/\">Divergent Vault</a>. The vault currently hosts over 100 free printables for your journaling needs. If you want to learn more before signing up, the <a href=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/divergent-vault/\">vault page</a> lists all available resources.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Instructions</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Each image of printable bookmarks is linked to the downloadable file on Google Drive. Once there, you can save it to your drive or download the file. When you print your file, set the scale to 100% so that you end up with four 2\" x 6\" bookmarks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Lost In My Journal Bookmarks</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":480,\"width\":\"400px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1NAbBqymXdCdm40z91trxKSH406etbdWz/view?usp=share_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/IMG_4684.jpeg\" alt=\"Journal Girls 01 - Free Printable Bookmarks\" class=\"wp-image-480\" style=\"width:400px\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":497,\"width\":\"404px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1bI1GImhuFijJpb-inAPxTJYJyoStHZ99/view?usp=share_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/journalgirl-02-1024x687.jpg\" alt=\"Journal Girls 02\" class=\"wp-image-497\" style=\"width:404px\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Abstract Watercolor Bookmarks</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":502,\"width\":\"400px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Kf2nwMynIa40zyeud9dXNrtw-I0IKCKd/view?usp=share_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/watercolor-bookmark-01-1024x714.png\" alt=\"Abstract Watercolor Bookmarks 01\" class=\"wp-image-502\" style=\"width:400px\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":504,\"width\":\"400px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DicZ2H9WIhJEPy4w2myR1dpd3QAczU-e/view?usp=share_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/watercolor-bookmark-02-1024x714.png\" alt=\"Abstract Watercolor Bookmarks 02\" class=\"wp-image-504\" style=\"width:400px\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":505,\"width\":\"400px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1YKLZ9cSBtgl7G33471-D5f6AYjfsrTGw/view?usp=share_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/watercolor-bookmark-03-1024x714.png\" alt=\"Abstract Watercolor Bookmarks 03\" class=\"wp-image-505\" style=\"width:400px\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":506,\"width\":\"400px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nUasrgsOMCOAKddwoEMoScM-amE33aae/view?usp=share_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/watercolor-bookmark-04-1024x714.png\" alt=\"Abstract Watercolor Bookmarks 04\" class=\"wp-image-506\" style=\"width:400px\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":507,\"width\":\"400px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1bcoAmjO_60pQ0H8PVP6TRdVbSpnKYOQo/view?usp=share_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/watercolor-bookmark-05-1024x714.jpg\" alt=\"Abstract Watercolor Bookmarks 05\" class=\"wp-image-507\" style=\"width:400px\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Magical Sky Bookmarks</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":498,\"width\":\"400px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1qwi2GHCNMRUjvK0xxhdjfdZuYcRR89Cb/view?usp=share_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/IMG_4752.jpg\" alt=\"Magical Sky Bookmarks\" class=\"wp-image-498\" style=\"width:400px\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Girls Rock Bookmarks</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":482,\"width\":\"400px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1sk1PlGM6aOkoIo-YDHna2t5AFfh66pFD/view?usp=share_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/IMG_4686.jpeg\" alt=\"Girls Rock Bookmarks\" class=\"wp-image-482\" style=\"width:400px\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Girls Rock! They do, anytime... anywhere... women are fantastic! The bookmark on the far right coordinates with my 200 page journal called <a href=\"https://sarahganaway.com/books/girls-rock-journal-6x9/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Girls Rock</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Moody Girl Bookmarks</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":483,\"width\":\"400px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1iQcVPdQIZV3eESBZFZfnupg2xgY5Lwvl/view?usp=share_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/IMG_4685.jpeg\" alt=\"Moody Girls Bookmarks\" class=\"wp-image-483\" style=\"width:400px\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some of these printable bookmarks are from digital wallpapers I have made that can also be found in the vault for free if you <a href=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/divergent-vault/\">sign up for access to the vault</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">DIY Bookmarks</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Any of these PDFs can be uploaded to Canva. You can then add and edit your quotes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I hope you find these useful and enjoyable!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Happy Journaling!<br>Sarah G</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
}